[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11290.03, "timestamp": "03:08:10", "text": "哦，那是吉萨菲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11291.15, "timestamp": "03:08:11", "text": "谢谢。队列。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11293.63, "timestamp": "03:08:13", "text": "托塞菲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11316.309, "timestamp": "03:08:36", "text": "嗯，顺便问一下，这个的FO是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11318.15, "timestamp": "03:08:38", "text": "所以，你们还有那台钻机吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11320.429, "timestamp": "03:08:40", "text": "现在可以了。是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11321.83, "timestamp": "03:08:41", "text": "我有那套设备。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11323.19, "timestamp": "03:08:43", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11326.83, "timestamp": "03:08:46", "text": "我已经加了很多油了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11327.83, "timestamp": "03:08:47", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11337.79, "timestamp": "03:08:57", "text": "动起来，动起来，动起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11338.229, "timestamp": "03:08:58", "text": "新宿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11338.79, "timestamp": "03:08:58", "text": "哦，它动了。"}]